  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Boosting the production and consumption of healthy, sustainable, and nutritious food in Rwanda&#xbf;s north-western region.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The action will support transparency pricing mechanism and fair rewards to the marginalised smallholders&#xbf; men and women due to increased efficiency along the chain as results of reduced transaction costs due to aggregations and reduced postharvest losses. In the selected districts, the proposed action includes activities to enhance agricultural inputs and to promote innovative and sustainable approaches and access to inputs through increased adoption of regenerative farming practices and climate-smart technologies for production of fruits, vegetables, and potatoes to boost food production&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
